\name{sharma_pukkala_species}
\alias{sharma_pukkala_species}
\title{List Sharma-Pukkala biomass species and parameters}
\usage{
sharma_pukkala_species()
}
\value{
A data frame containing supported species, biomass parameters, air-dry
density, sample size, and observed DBH calibration range.
}
\description{
Lists the 21 named species and two explicit miscellaneous groups available
for the Sharma and Pukkala (1990) air-dry biomass method.
}
